---
// The short version: five sticky notes taped to the sheet, three over two.
---

<section class="pv-sec" id="tldr" aria-labelledby="pv-tldr-h">
  <header class="pv-head">
    <p class="pv-num" aria-hidden="true">1</p>
    <p class="pv-kicker">tl;dr · for the busy</p>
    <h2 id="pv-tldr-h">The short version</h2>
  </header>

  <ul class="pv-notes">
    <li class="pv-note">
      <span class="pv-note-n" aria-hidden="true">i.</span>
      <h3>On by default</h3>
      <p>
        Release builds send usage stats by default. A notice on first launch
        says so, and nothing is sent until you answer it.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="pv-note">
      <span class="pv-note-n" aria-hidden="true">ii.</span>
      <h3>One switch</h3>
      <p>
        Settings → Privacy has one switch that turns it off. Off means nothing
        more is sent, and whatever was waiting to be sent is thrown away.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="pv-note">
      <span class="pv-note-n" aria-hidden="true">iii.</span>
      <h3>A delete button</h3>
      <p>
        <b>Delete my data</b> erases what the server holds for your phone,
        then turns sharing off.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li class="pv-note">
      <span class="pv-note-n" aria-hidden="true">iv.</span>
      <h3>Dev builds keep quiet</h3>
      <p>Development builds send nothing.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="pv-note">
      <span class="pv-note-n" aria-hidden="true">v.</span>
      <h3>Not for sale</h3>
      <p>
        Nothing is sold or shared, and none of it goes into the public code
        repository.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .pv-notes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px) clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 0 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .pv-note {
    --tilt: -2deg;
    position: relative;
    grid-column: span 2;
    padding: 30px 22px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: var(--panel);
    box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--accent);
    rotate: var(--tilt);
    transition: rotate 0.35s var(--pv-spring), translate 0.35s var(--pv-spring), box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .pv-note:nth-child(n + 4) { grid-column: span 3; }
  .pv-note:nth-child(2) { --tilt: 1.5deg; background: linear-gradient(var(--accent-soft) 0 0), var(--panel); }
  .pv-note:nth-child(3) { --tilt: -1deg; background: linear-gradient(var(--red-soft) 0 0), var(--panel); }
  .pv-note:nth-child(4) { --tilt: 1deg; }
  .pv-note:nth-child(5) { --tilt: -1.5deg; background: linear-gradient(var(--accent-soft) 0 0), var(--panel); }
  /* A strip of tape holding each one up. */
  .pv-note::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    width: 64px;
    height: 20px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--accent-line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent);
    translate: -50% 0;
    rotate: calc(var(--tilt) * -2);
  }
  .pv-note:hover {
    rotate: 0deg;
    translate: 0 -5px;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .pv-note-n {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 18px;
    font: italic 400 30px/1 var(--serif);
    color: var(--red);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .pv-note h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding-right: 34px;
    font: 400 clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 30px)/1.02 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .pv-note p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .pv-note b { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 500; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .pv-notes { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .pv-note,
    .pv-note:nth-child(n + 4) { grid-column: span 1; }
    .pv-note:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .pv-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pv-note { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
